  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EgMRsL2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">关于：</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">《玩具坦克大乱斗》是一款异步PVP游戏，让你与好友在可爱的小坦克中展开对决。</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">收集最多金币，赢取皇家王冠。</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">但要小心……一旦阵亡，你将损失一半金币！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">特色：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3cc\">支持任意数量的玩家</span></li>\n<li>8种游戏模式（包括夺旗模式）</li>\n<li>动态竞技场会随玩家数量变化而调整</li>\n<li>12种独特强化道具可在战场收集</li>\n<li>AI坦克（最多<strong>64</strong>台！）</li>\n<li>管理员菜单可实时调整游戏设置</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">制作团队：</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3cc\"><strong>美术 --</strong>&nbsp;Frenderman</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3cc\"><strong>架构 --</strong>&nbsp;MCFilms</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3cc\"><strong>编程 --</strong>&nbsp;Flamingosaurus</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">地图创作活动？</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本地图专为2021年StickyPiston地图创作活动打造。每个团队需在7天内围绕四大主题之一创作支持8人联机的地图。我们选择了“无尽”主题。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/urrHnOsJJdo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/t5iGQdEGn44?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>",
